     "note": "REAL - TSTR write (:1176-1194) starts timers with no timer_hz check; consequence is step=0 and a silently frozen timer, not a crash. landisk unaffected (OpenBSD writes TCR first).",
     "ev": "pipeline/evidence/_dispatches/fable5_assess_2026-08-15.md",
