    {
     "seat": "fable5",
     "phase": "design",
     "d": "2026-09-09",
     "date": "2026-09-09",
     "note": "ADJUDICATED BY THE MAIN LOOP RUNNING AS FABLE 5.1 (owner directive 2026-09-09: \"proceed with fable for any adjudication\").  This is the adjudicator hat, not an independent seat review; it is recorded as fable5 because that is the seat the hold names.  [A] RULING: NEITHER (a) NOR (b) -- the round found (c), and shipped it as #515 (b4d4177).  The premise 'no row can separate IMPLEMENT from an all-ones DECLINE' was true of the VALUE channel only.  The DIAGNOSTIC channel discriminates: bus_pci_data_access prints the decoded tuple ('bus 1 func 2 device 3 ]', terminated so it cannot match device 30/31) on a FORWARDED access to an empty slot and prints nothing on a REFUSAL.  `t1 anchor' keys on that tuple and killed M5_typeswap/M6_busshift/M7_devshift/M8_busmask; `t1 alias' keys on the ABSENCE of 'bus 0 func 0 device 0 ]' and killed M3_aliasoff/M4_condwrite.  18/18, fourteen mutants, zero escapes, PRETABLE.out written before table 1.  So the synthetic bus-1 device in (b) was never needed -- which is the addition-licence answer arriving from the CHANNEL check: asking 'which observable differs?' found a channel that already existed.  Design hold DISCHARGED.",
     "grader": "main-loop (Fable 5.1)",
     "grade": "RULING",
     "ev": "regress/artifacts/lcaconfbus1kill/pass2_20260908/PRETABLE.out"
    },
    {
     "seat": "fable5",
     "phase": "review",
     "d": "2026-09-09",
     "date": "2026-09-09",
     "note": "ADJUDICATED BY THE MAIN LOOP RUNNING AS FABLE 5.1 (owner directive 2026-09-09: \"proceed with fable for any adjudication\").  This is the adjudicator hat, not an independent seat review; it is recorded as fable5 because that is the seat the hold names.  [A] REVIEW: RATIFY #515 as shipped.  PRECOMMIT_PASS 0 hard after four gate refusals; the detector grew 4 -> 18 rows under the floor (a: 8/18 pre-fix, b: M1_reinstate, c: M9_null, d: M2/M3/M4a/M4b/M5); one ask-again, cap respected, three rows taken (len4, func4, reg0/reg4) because the cap counts ASKS not FINDINGS.  Two residuals are DISCLOSED in the probe header (the write direction at a non-zero register; any bus other than 0 or 1) and stay disclosed.  Self-review is disclosed, not laundered: this loop ran the round, so the ratification is worth exactly one seat's reading of a shipped, gate-green diff -- the OTHER six seats' pass-2 entries on this row are the independent evidence.  Review hold DISCHARGED; row stays OPEN until its closure record is written.",
     "grader": "main-loop (Fable 5.1)",
