   "title": "wdc_addtoinbuf_probe.py -- a single-leg mode plus a pass/fail contract for the ONE WDC two-leg differential that is genuinely infrastructure-blocked: it imports none of wdc_altoffset_probe, carries its own pty/Emu, ties its expectations to DISK CONTENT (needs a POISONED image the battery does not build), and adds an endianness axis (-e maltabe).  RETITLED 2026-09-09 from 'all four WDC differentials': the other three are one instrument (`import wdc_altoffset_probe as W') and belong to `wdcaltoffleg'.  Its wiringcliff exemption is re-dated naming THIS row and DELETED in the same edit as its wiring when this ships.",
