sgitexindex low open dev_sgi_re.c's CRIME_RE_TEX index uses >> 3 where its three sibling arms use >> 1 -- consecutive writes overlap by three entries and 81 of 112 are unreachable
sgimtewidth med open sgi_mte serves EVERY access width and a one-byte store silently ZEROES the adjacent register -- and the obvious fix for its dead arm would CREATE a width kill
