The guard checks have removed several candidates. The MK48 clock default is unreachable: the early return leaves only the control-register address, which has its own case. The two PPC BAT helper exits are also excluded by their caller. The 7-segment default is live, however: its registered window contains gaps beyond the two implemented addresses.
